  conversationName: Shopkeeper1
  lines:
  - text: 'Haven''t seen you in a while. '
    expressionKey: shp_normal
  - text: You're lucky I managed to catch your ship before it ran out of fuel.
    expressionKey: shp_normal
  - text: You still owe me a lot of scrap, so go out there and fish for some.
    expressionKey: shp_unamused
  - text: You can auto-navigate to the system I assigned using your terminal.
    expressionKey: shp_normal
  - text: After you're done, record your progress and I'll assign your next mission.
    expressionKey: shp_normal
  - text: Also... if you run out of fuel again, I can't promise little old me will
      be there to save you.
    expressionKey: shp_normal
  nextDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a002a662ce3534f43902b89b2e9d372e, type: 2}
